  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UY Non Communicable Diseases Prevention Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation would seek to support the Government&apos;s efforts to further strengthen its health delivery services and the current health policy framework for NCD. In this contextcomma the specific development objectives of the proposed operation would be:  (i) To expand accessibility and quality of primary health care services related to selected NCD s early detection and medical care; and (ii) To avoid and reduce exposure to selected NCDs risk factors as well as their health effects</narrative>
  </description>
